@startuml
title FE-05 Convert Accepted Request to Custom Order
actor Staff
actor Manager
participant HumanReviewService
participant CustomOrderService
participant DesignRequestFacade
database CustomOrderRepository
database CustomOrderQuoteRepository
Staff -> HumanReviewService : accept request with explanation
HumanReviewService -> DesignRequestFacade : request accepted snapshot
DesignRequestFacade --> CustomOrderService : immutable design/request snapshot
CustomOrderService -> CustomOrderRepository : create custom order
CustomOrderService -> CustomOrderQuoteRepository : create quote draft
CustomOrderService --> Staff : quote preparation result
Manager -> CustomOrderService : open quote for approval
CustomOrderService --> Manager : quote projection and version
@enduml
